# ccvitals — VHS tape for assets/demo.gif
# Regenerate with:  vhs assets/demo.tape

Output assets/demo.gif

Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1100
Set Height 480
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "clear" Enter
Show

Type "./assets/demo.sh"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 15s
